        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The survey found that people in the UK throw away about 1.6 billion pieces of plastic every week. Most plastic comes from "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and drink "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "packages",
            "zh": "包装"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". These "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "include",
            "ref": "v-include"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " snack bags, fruit wrappers and drink bottles. Much of the plastic is “soft plastic”. This kind of plastic is "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
